        "text": "As we all know, payments companies and regulated enterprises have strict requirements such as the need for privacy, payment attribution, reversibility, and access controls. Token extensions provide for all of these requirements natively, which means that developers can use one program for all of their needs. Regulatory and business requirements that may have precipitated the need to spin up a private chain can now all be satisfied by the native attributes of the digital asset itself.",
